{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_13218240","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13218240","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"cinematic_dialogue:2:1321823001:":{"text":"I can feel it...","source_cn":"我感觉到了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD957B9B18E3CA5F0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1321823002:":{"text":"The resonance of blood!","source_cn":"血脉的共鸣！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0B3D93F64DA5D853","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1321824001:1":{"text":"There's a faint connection between the girl's mother and my own lineage... She carries Valesa blood, though she isn't of the direct line.","source_cn":"女孩母亲的遗骸与我有了隐约的共鸣，也就是说……虽然稀薄...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3CF3AFF5CCCD5E06","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1321824002:1":{"text":"Then... could it be that the Hypogeans targeted her father because of her mother's remains?","source_cn":"也就是说……那些恶魔眷属感受到了这位女士遗骨中的血脉能...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA9F8E4EA33F9EE5D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1321824003:1":{"text":"Given the clues we now have, that seems to be the case.","source_cn":"从现有的条件来看，的确如此。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x46F11D021776FD46","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1321824004:1":{"text":"If all of this is true, then Orla... must have inherited the ancient and noble blood of Valesa from her mother.","source_cn":"如果这一切都成立，那么奥尔嘉……她当然也从她的母亲那里...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC29CA798BACF7488","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1321824005:1":{"text":"That makes her a member of the Valesa family... I'm surprised the Valesa family still has an heir.","source_cn":"所以这个孩子就是瓦勒沙家族之人，瓦勒沙家族……竟然还有...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF042F5310B11B26A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1321824006:1":{"text":"My magic has never failed me. By my ancestors... could it be that our family still endures?","source_cn":"我的魔法……我的魔法应该是不会出错的，所以这一切都是真...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9236FC137A1D0699","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1321824007:1":{"text":"Mr. Faramor, might I examine any journals or documents Orla's father carried? They may hold the proof we need.","source_cn":"法拉莫尔，我想看看奥尔嘉父亲携带的笔记或者文件，或许能...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF833AC5FD81C53E4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1321824008:1":{"text":"We should ask Orla's permission.","source_cn":"这需要奥尔嘉的同意。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD541CF8DE4165D0F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1321824009:1":{"text":"Orla, don't be afraid. This gentleman only wishes to confirm your lineage. Would you allow him to look through any records your father left behind?","source_cn":"奥尔嘉，没事的，不要一直躲在我背后。这位先生希望能确认...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCCF8145E357C2FDE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1321824010:1":{"text":"Valesa family? Descendant? I don't understand...","source_cn":"瓦勒沙家族？后裔？我不懂你说的话……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x74C7E95C2B599AE5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1321824011:1":{"text":"Papa didn't keep a journal, but Mama did... I always have it with me since she passed away. Go ahead and read it.","source_cn":"我爸爸没有什么笔记，但妈妈有一本……她去世以后我一直随...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEDC6C99EF386F4D1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1321824012:1":{"text":"Thank you, Orla.","source_cn":"谢谢你，奥尔嘉。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA8E252FE2190199A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:24:13021828:0":{"text":"Ludovic confirms the lineage of Orla's mother through a bloodline-sensing magic. He seems to find his answer when the circle lights up.","source_cn":"柳博米尔通过血脉感应的魔法阵来确认奥尔嘉母亲的身世，伴...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2E170A88E780652D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:柳博米尔":{"text":"Ludovic","source":"柳博米尔","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:法拉莫尔":{"text":"Faramor","source":"法拉莫尔","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:卡列琳娜":{"text":"Carolina","source":"卡列琳娜","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:奥尔嘉":{"text":"Orla","source":"奥尔嘉","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:黑屏字幕":{"text":"Subtitles","source":"黑屏字幕","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":20,"localized_text_count":15,"speaker_count":5}}